<title>USA: Groupe Danone names Spagnolo Dannon Co CEO.</title>
<headline>Groupe Danone names Spagnolo Dannon Co CEO.</headline>
<dateline>TARRYTOWN, N.Y. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groupe Danone said it named Antonio Spagnolo as president and chief executive officer of the Dannon Co, effective January 1.</p>
<p>Spagnolo was previously CEO of Danone Italy, it said.</p>
<p>The company also said it named Patrick Gournay senior executive vice president of the North and South American division. Gournay had been president and CEO of the Dannon Co.</p>
<p>Gournay would now have strategic and coordinating responsibilities for dairy products and mineral waters in Canada, the United States, Mexico and Latin America, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
